OL,3,GNEWSAMan City lease reviewed amid
OL,4,AEtihad Campus expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester City's lease at the Etihad
OL,7,FStadium was placed under review last
OL,8,Fmonth amid a major expansion of the
OL,9,Fclub's east Manchester campus, it has
OL,10,Femerged.
OL,12,FCity has a long-term lease at the
OL,13,Fground with Manchester City Council and
OL,14,Ffinished expanding its north stand
OL,15,Fearlier this year, which increased the
OL,16,Fstadium capacity to more than 60,000
OL,17,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
