OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan City lease reviewed amid
OL,4,AEtihad Campus expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been building a new #300m
OL,7,Fentertainment zone known as Medlock
OL,8,FSquare which includes a Radisson Blu
OL,9,FHotel and a zip-line, with plans for a
OL,10,Fnew 600-person capacity entertainment
OL,11,Fvenue which the council granted
OL,12,Fplanning permission in June.
OL,14,FThe lease review was sparked as a
OL,15,Fresult of changes taking place around
OL,16,Fthe Etihad Campus, the Local Democracy
OL,17,FReporting Service (LDRS) understands.
